Escalation gates

• Home pest concerns: visually inspect before treatment; licensed pest management if structural termites, carpenter ant nesting, or significant unknown damage is suspected.
• Toxicology/foraging: never infer human safety from animal use.
• Experimental releases: no release of species, engineered microbes, or exogenous chemicals into ecosystems without appropriate review and authorization.
• Public observations: redact precise home addresses and sensitive species locations.